      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER MAX (8) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 1.3 lengths (24.42) at this track in a Grade 5 over 425m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. One of the contenders. SHREK'S BROTHER (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (19.67) at Healesville. Can feature again. LAURA MAY (1) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at this track over 425m behind Where's Huntly (25.23) in a Special conditions H. Worth following up. AUNTIE AMBER (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
